    "success_means": "README states no benchmark; in the code and docs success is a genome whose fitness meets the config fitness_threshold under fitness_criterion (XOR example: fitness = 4 - sum of squared errors, threshold 3.9), plus the test suite (README: 618 total) and coverage badge."
